Provides: news-transport-system
Description: InterNetNews news server, C++20/CMake conversion (alpha)
 INN++ is a conversion of INN 2.8, the InterNetNews Usenet server, to
 C++20 and CMake.  It includes innd (the transit server), nnrpd (the
 reader server, with TLS), innfeed, the storage and overview methods,
 and embedded Perl and Python filters.
 .
 This is an alpha release, not for production use.
